Theme palettes — Security Onion Solutions, LLC
================================================================================

Used in: companion/scripts/theme/vendor/themePalettes.ts
         public/dashboard.html (the generated :root[data-theme="..."] blocks)

The colour palettes behind 22 of the dashboard's themes come from an MIT-licensed
theme set published by the copyright holder named below. The role names those
palettes are keyed by are also that project's names, which is what allows its
themes to be used here without translation.

No source code from it is included — only colour values and the role names they
are keyed by. Its own `dark` and `light` themes are not used, and one theme is
excluded because its body text does not meet the contrast floor this project
enforces.

