Colour schemes named in the theme picker
----------------------------------------

Several of those palettes are renditions of colour schemes maintained by other
projects: Catppuccin, Everforest, Gruvbox, Kanagawa, Nord, Rosé Pine and Tokyo
Night. Colour values are not themselves copyrightable and each of those projects
is permissively licensed; they are credited by name in the picker as a courtesy
